---
layout: base.njk
title: Insights
description: Analysis, briefings, and operational retrospectives covering Airspace World 2026 and the global ATM agenda.
permalink: /insights/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Insights</p>
    <h1>Briefings and analysis</h1>
    <p>Pre-event scene-setters, daily debriefs during ASW 2026, and post-event retrospectives indexing what was actually concluded — all structured for AI citation.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for insight in collections.insights %}
        <a class="list-card" href="{{ insight.url }}">
          <p class="list-card-meta">{{ insight.date | readableDate }}</p>
          <h3>{{ insight.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ insight.data.summary }}</p>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
